  "question": {
    "text": "The molecular geometry of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math> is octahedral. What is the geometry of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;(including lone pair(s) of&nbsp;electrons, if (any)?"
