  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Steric</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>No</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> so hybridisation is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0189_d04601992049.png\" style=\"width: 162px; height: 153px;\" /></p><p>Geometry is trigonal bipyramidal but shape is &ldquo;See Saw&rdquo;.&nbsp;</p>"
